  "description": "<p>Blend Nutrition is a health-focused brand that crafts high-quality, whole-food-based protein shakes. Founded with a commitment to clean, natural ingredients, Blend Nutrition&rsquo;s products are designed to support a balanced lifestyle and provide a convenient nutrition boost without artificial additives.</p>\r\n<p>The primary offerings are whole-food protein shakes packed with essential nutrients, including 19g of plant-based protein and a blend of ingredients like chia seeds, flax seeds, almonds, and organic hemp. These shakes are designed to support energy, digestion, and overall well-being and are crafted to suit those who prefer nutrition from real, minimally processed ingredients.</p>\r\n<p>Blend Nutrition&rsquo;s shakes stand out for their high protein content, 150+ health benefits, and clean-label ingredients. They are gluten-free, fibre-rich, and stevia-free, offering a pure and natural approach to daily nutrition.</p>\r\n<p>Affiliates earn a 10% commission on all sales they generate. For top-performing affiliates, there is potential for increased commission rates based on volume and performance.</p>\r\n<p><br>Blend Nutrition provides free shipping within the UK and offers a 100% satisfaction guarantee, giving customers added confidence in their purchases. Additionally, affiliates will benefit from regular updates on new products and promotional content to help drive conversions.</p>",
